      text: (t, st, ab) => `An ancestral bear rises beside a foe and mauls it three times over 1.5s, ${xD(st, 1.5)} each (half again on a hexed foe); the third blow stuns it ${byT(ab.by.stun, t)}s (bosses briefly).`,
