/* =====================================================================================================
   THORNGUARD SPEARS: the living shield-wall. They hold the line; the road itself grows spears for them.
   ===================================================================================================== */
// Thornhedge: the shield slammed into the road; a hedge of thorns grows across it at the road cell beside the Spears
