/* ================= THE STORMBORN'S CAPSTONES: the mechanics the spell-mod system can't express =================
   The owner (7 Nov 2026): "the capstone talents are also a bit underwhelming ... ensure they are worthy of a capstone.
   also shouldnt have more than 3 capstones per unit." The audit is docs/capstone_audit.md. The talents
   themselves live in their trees (forces_stormborn_b.js, forces_zs_stormborn.js, forces_zx_champ_stormborn.js); what
   their sp entries can say (riders, vs, ready, kill) is said there. This file holds the rest. It loads after every other
   forces_* file, so the spells are their final selves. Each wrapper keeps the original call.
     Wolfguard        Restless Spear (sbcRestless): a second Stormpin on the next toughest walker, half the thunderbolts
     Windrunners      Walking Wind (sbcWalkWind): Skyward Gust's column walks back up the road
     Hail Shamans     Hail Cairn (sbcCairn): a Skystone drops a hailstone on the foe nearest it every second
     Spirit Walkers   Walk On (sbcWalkOn): the spirit steps into a second foe; The Final Tally (sbcTally): a free Toll
     Thunder Callers  Stormseed (sbcSeed): every 4th bolt plants a storm totem where its chain ends
     Earthbinders     Widening Earth (sbcWiden): a second pit; Storm Mire (sbcMire): lightning runs through the pit;
                      Mountain's Echo (sbcEcho): each stomp quakes every Stone Totem of its own
     Cloud Dancers    Breaking Sky (sbcBreak): its clouds break as the Storm rises; Many Skies (sbcMany): Skyleap from each cloud
     Skyhunters       Twin Harpoon (sbsTwin): a second Skyfall Harpoon; Master of the Sky (sbsCord): harpoons leap held flyer to flyer
     Tarka            Two Tomorrows (sbcTwoDays), Storm Caller (sbcCaller), Drum in the Rain (sbcRainDrum)
     Oshana           Twin Gale (sbcTwinGale), Road's End (sbcRoadEnd)
     Huri             Stormcarrier (sbcCarry), Blood Trail (sbcTrail), Beastcaller (sbcBeast)
   A spell's second cast (Restless Spear, Walk On, Twin Harpoon, Widening Earth, Twin Gale, Stormcarrier, Blood Trail)
   is a free cast of the spell itself, so its look, its talents and its feed of the Storm come with it, and it never
   casts a third (_sbcAgain). The looks reuse what each spell already draws: nothing new on screen but a few bolts. */

/* ---------- helpers ---------- */
