    /* --- storm --- */
    // modelled on a game lightning-bolt impact: a bright snap as the bolt leaves the obelisk, then the hit itself, a
    // dense, sizzling wash of electric noise (broad and even from the low mids to the very top, near-steady rather than
    // crackly) that slams in, holds for a beat and then fizzles away over most of a second, with a low boom swelling
