  // the forces' own painted layers (the spell pass): strips for ribbons (BOLT, SHAFT, FAN, CHAIN: u along, v across), sprites
  // and ground discs (RUNE, SUN, GLYPH, CLOCK, COG, WRING, CRACK, SLASH, FLAME, PUFF), painted cards in their own colours
