/* The shared fire's flames (hammerfire.js: the Steam Hammers' vents, the burning patches, the Pyroclasts' hands and glyphs) and
   its flying fire (the incendiary shell, the fireballs) drawn from the lab's own loops instead of the small solver: a flame is the
   lab's Gas jet, rooted where the flame was and streaming its way (a jet's way, or up and back along its motion); a ball in flight
   the lab's Fireball, its flame streaming back along the flight. The sizes follow the old cards (hfQueue's s: the flame's scale). */
